cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Single-cell Integration
abstract: 'Joint integration and clustering of single-cell and single-nucleus RNA-seq samples: highly variable genes
  on the counts across batches (Seurat v3 method), a joint PCA, Harmony or scVI integration, Leiden clusters and
  a UMAP on the integrated embedding, with scib batch and cluster silhouette metrics before and after integration.'
